[IQ Generator Preset]
# Lesson 21: 4-level ASK.
# 4-ASK uses four non-negative amplitudes, 0, 1, 2 and 3 (scaled to unit mean energy). All the points lie on the I axis at or above zero, so the signal has a non-zero mean and the spectrum shows a strong line at 0 Hz, unlike bipolar 4-PAM (lesson 14). The top level carries most of the power: its energy is 9 against 1 for the next level.
